or source. The creator reads the player's already-converted installation.
Its resulting private pack contains original game asset DATA (animations,
graphs, physics configuration and a converted skin/board). Those assets
retain their original owners' copyrights and are not licensed under the GPL.
No original game executables, native libraries or Lua scripts are packed.
